yle=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top><div style=left:81pt;position:absolute;top:456pt;width:75pt><div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;top:2.63pt;width:75pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;left:2.63pt;width:71.37pt;line-height:10pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">否</div></div></div></div></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top><div style=left:159pt;position:absolute;top:456pt;width:75pt><div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;top:2.63pt;width:75pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;left:2.63pt;width:71.37pt;line-height:10pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">否</div></div></div></div></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top><div style=left:237pt;position:absolute;top:456pt;width:75pt><div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;top:2.63pt;width:75pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-.98pt;left:2.63pt;width:70.39pt;line-height:8pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">发生若干事件时可由我们无偿赎回</div></div></div></div></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top><div style=left:315pt;position:absolute;top:456pt;width:75pt><div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;top:2.63pt;width:75pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-.98pt;left:2.63pt;width:70.39pt;line-height:8pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">发生若干事件时可由我们无偿赎回</div></div></div></div></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top><div style=left:393pt;position:absolute;top:456pt;width:75pt><div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;top:2.63pt;width:75pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-.98pt;left:2.63pt;width:70.39pt;line-height:8pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">发生若干事件时可由我们无偿赎回</div></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:641.45pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">有关我们资本结构的更多信息，参见“股本说明”一节。</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:9.07pt;position:absolute;top:661.85pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.96pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:15pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">风险因素概要</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:685.25pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.28pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们的业务面临众多风险和不确定性，包括紧随本招股说明书概要之后的“风险因素”一节所强调的风险和不确定性。这些风险可能对我们的业务、财务状况及经营业绩产生不利影响，进而可能导致我们A类普通股的市场价格</div></div></div></div><div class=s1-sheet style="--justify:justify;--position:absolute;background-color:#fff;border:1px solid #cccc;content-visibility:auto;float:none;font-size:0;height:792pt;margin:10px auto;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:relative;width:612pt"><div style="background-image:url(data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%20style=%22pointer-events:none%22%3E%3Cpath%20style=%22fill:transparent;stroke:%23000;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-width:1pt%22%20d=%22M48.67%2048.67V983.33H767.33V48.67H48.67%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E);background-size:612pt 792pt;height:792pt;position:absolute;width:612pt;z-index:-9223372036854775805"></div><div style=position:absolute;top:720pt><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:22.27pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:301.27pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre>16</font></div></div></div><div style=position:absolute><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:6.46pt;position:absolute;top:13.5pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.4pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.25pt;font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f"><a href=#if79d5262bb1f4e24ac84b67b9de9b345_12633 style=color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit>目录</a></span></div></div></div></div><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:72pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.26pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">下跌，并可能导致您损失全部或部分投资。除下文所概述或本招股说明书其他部分所讨论的风险外，其他风险亦可能在我们目前经营或未来可能经营的市场中，适用于我们目前开展或未来可能开展的业务、活动或运营。这些风险包括：</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:126.6pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.24pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们的成功在很大程度上取决于我们能否持续开发最先进、能力最强的AI模型，任何未能做到这一点的情况均可能对我们的业务产生不利影响。</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:158.4pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.22pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">如果我们无法获得充足的算力，或未能在各项工作负载之间有效调配算力，我们可能无法训练出与竞争对手保持竞争力的模型，或无法充分服务我们的客户。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:201.6pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.17pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">支撑算力的关键投入要素受到的约束可能限制我们获得充足算力的能力。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:233.4pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.26pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们高度依赖联合创始人、高级管理团队及关键技术员工的持续服务，失去其中任何人员均可能对我们的业务、财务状况及经营业绩产生不利影响。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:276.6pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.23pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们的公司文化促成了我们的成功；如果我们在发展过程中无法保持这一文化，我们的业务可能受到不利影响。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:308.4pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.16pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们面临激烈竞争，如果我们无法有效竞争，我们的业务、财务状况及经营业绩可能受到不利影响。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:340.2pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.29pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">如果我们的模型、平台及应用的市场发展慢于预期或出现萎缩，我们的增长可能放缓或停滞，我们的业务、财务状况及经营业绩可能受到不利影响。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:383.4pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.24pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">如果我们的AI模型的使用造成损害（无论是因恶意行为者的使用还是其他第三方的滥用），或者我们的模型护栏或安全保障措施未能防止此类滥用，我们的声誉和品牌、业务、财务状况及经营业绩可能受到不利影响。</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:426.6pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.28pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们的AI模型可能以非预期、未对齐或自主的方式行事，包括采取任何用户或第三方均未指示的有害行动，这可能对我们的声誉和品牌、业务、财务状况及经营业绩产生不利影响。</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:469.8pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.27pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们可能因与我们的AI模型相关的损害而承担责任、面临诉讼及监管行动，而我们的合同保护和保险可能不足，上述任何情况均可能对我们的业务、财务状况及经营业绩产生不利影响。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:513pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.23pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们相当大部分的收入和应收账款来自有限数量的客户和分销渠道，失去一名或多名主要客户或其支出大幅减少，或该等渠道受到干扰，均可能对我们的前景、业务及财务状况产生不利影响。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:567.6pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.28pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们在一个不断演变的新兴行业中经营历史有限，这使我们的未来前景难以评估，并可能增加我们无法取得成功的风险。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:599.4pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.21pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们正处于收入增长的早期阶段，近期经历了快速增长，而我们的历史增长率并不预示未来业绩，亦不代表我们维持或预测未来收入增长的能力。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:642.6pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.25pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们的业务面临不断演变且不确定的监管和政治环境，这可能增加我们的成本、限制我们的运营，或对我们的模型、平台及应用的需求产生不利影响。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:685.8pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.18pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们依赖有限数量的云服务提供商和供应商（其中部分与我们存在战略和投资关系，且同时是我们的客户），由此形成的复杂关系可能引发利益冲突，并对我们获取算力产生不利影响。</div></div></div></div><div class=s1-sheet style="--justify:justify;--position:absolute;background-color:#fff;border:1px solid #cccc;content-visibility:auto;float:none;font-size:0;height:792pt;margin:10px auto;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:relative;width:612pt"><div style="background-image:url(data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%20style=%22pointer-events:none%22%3E%3Cpath%20style=%22fill:transparent;stroke:%23000;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-width:1pt%22%20d=%22M48.67%2048.67V983.33H767.33V48.67H48.67%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E);background-size:612pt 792pt;height:792pt;position:absolute;width:612pt;z-index:-9223372036854775805"></div><div style=position:absolute;top:720pt><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:22.27pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:301.57pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre>17</font></div></div></div><div style=position:absolute><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:6.46pt;position:absolute;top:13.5pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.4pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.25pt;font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f"><a href=#if79d5262bb1f4e24ac84b67b9de9b345_12633 style=color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit>目录</a></span></div></div></div></div><div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:72pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.28pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们的股本结构包含若干新颖或在其他多类别股份结构公司中并不常见的条款，可能实际上使A类普通股持有人丧失影响重要决策（包括控制权变更）的能力。</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:115.2pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.26pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">在可预见的未来，我们的资本结构将使投票权集中于LTBT和Founder LLC，并导致LTBT和Founder LLC所拥有的投票权并非源自其在本公司的经济权益，亦与之不成比例。</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:158.4pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.29pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">作为PBC，我们注重本公司的长期最佳利益，且我们的董事有义务平衡股东的金钱利益、受我们行为重大影响的利益相关者的最佳利益以及我们的公司宗旨，这可能与短期、中期或长期的财务利益及业务表现相冲突，从而可能对我们A类普通股的价值产生负面影响。</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:9.07pt;position:absolute;top:224.4pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.96pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:15pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">信息披露渠道</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:247.8pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.29pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">投资者、媒体及其他人士应注意，本次发行完成后，我们拟通过以下渠道向公众公布重大信息：向美国证券交易委员会（“SEC”）提交的文件、我们网站（www.anthropic.com）上的投资者关系页面、我们网站上的博客文章、新闻稿、公开电话会议、公开网络直播、我们的X账号（@AnthropicAI和@ClaudeAI）、我们的Instagram页面（@claudeai）、我们的Threads账号（@claudeai）以及我们的LinkedIn页面（https:// www.linkedin.com/company/anthropicresearch/）。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:325.2pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.28pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">通过上述渠道披露的信息可能被视为重大信息。因此，本次发行完成后，我们鼓励投资者、媒体及其他人士关注上述渠道，并查阅通过该等渠道披露的信息。我们并未将该等渠道中的任何信息纳入本招股说明书。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:379.8pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.17pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们用于公布信息的披露渠道清单如有任何更新，将在我们网站的投资者关系页面上发布。</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:9.07pt;position:absolute;top:411.6pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.96pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:15pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">公司信息</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:435pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.28pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们于2021年1月注册成立为特拉华州PBC。我们的主要行政办公室位于548 Market Street, PMB 90375, San Francisco, California 94104，电话号码为(415) 326-6303。我们的网址为www.anthropic.com。我们网站上所载的或可通过我们网站访问的信息不构成本招股说明书的一部分，本招股说明书中对我们网址的提及仅为非活动文本引用。您不应将我们网站上所载的信息视为本招股说明书的一部分，亦不应在决定是否购买我们的A类普通股时考虑该等信息。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:512.4pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.25pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400">“Anthropic”、我们的标志以及本招股说明书中出现的我们的其他注册商标或普通法商标、服务标志或商号，均为</span>Anthropic, PBC的财产。本招股说明书中提及的其他商标和商号均为其各自所有者的财产。仅为方便起见，本招股说明书中提及的商标和商号可能未附有®或™符号，但该等提及无意以任何方式表明我们将不会在适用法律允许的最大范围内主张我们或任何适用许可方对该等商标和商号的权利。</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=ch-the-offering><h2 class=dl-ch>本次发行</h2><div class=s1-sheets data-first-page=29><div class=s1-sheets-inner><div class=s1-sheet style="--justify:justify;--position:absolute;background-color:#fff;border:1px solid #cccc;content-visibility:auto;float:none;font-size:0;height:792pt;margin:10px auto;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:relative;width:612pt"><div style="background-image:url(data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%20style=%22pointer-events:none%22%3E%3Cpath%20style=%22fill:transparent;stroke:%23000;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-width:1pt%22%20d=%22M48.67%2048.67V983.33H767.33V48.67H48.67%22/