ertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top><div style=left:212.25pt;position:absolute;top:192.75pt;width:255.75pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:12.52pt;width:255.75pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:2.63pt;width:252.12pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">1股</div></div></div></div></td></tr><tr style=height:3pt><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td></tr><tr style=height:50.25pt><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top><div style=position:absolute;top:219pt;width:209.25pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:2.63pt;width:209.25pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.16pt;left:2.63pt;width:191.67pt;line-height:9.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">本次发行后将发行在外的A类、N类、T类、E类及F类普通股</div></div></div></div></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top><div style=left:212.25pt;position:absolute;top:219pt;width:255.75pt><div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:20.52pt;width:255.75pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.16pt;left:2.63pt;width:252.74pt;line-height:9.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">          股（如承销商全额行使其购买额外A类普通股股份的选择权，则为          股）</div></div></div></div></td></tr><tr style=height:3pt><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td></tr><tr style=height:308.25pt><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top><div style=position:absolute;top:272.25pt;width:209.25pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:2.63pt;width:209.25pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:2.63pt;width:205.62pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">所得款项用途</div></div></div></div></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top><div style=left:212.25pt;position:absolute;top:272.25pt;width:255.75pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:2.63pt;width:255.75pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.16pt;left:2.63pt;width:252.78pt;line-height:9.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">按照每股          美元的假定首次公开发行价格（即本招股说明书封面所载预计发行价格区间的中间值）计算，并扣除预计承销折扣及佣金以及由我们支付的预计发行费用后，我们估计本次发行中我们出售A类普通股股份的所得款项净额约为          美元（如承销商全额行使购买额外A类普通股股份的选择权，则约为          美元）。我们不会从出售股东出售A类普通股股份中获得任何所得款项。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:125.63pt;width:255.75pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.16pt;left:2.63pt;width:252.78pt;line-height:9.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">本次发行的主要目的是增强我们的资本实力和财务灵活性、为我们的A类普通股创建公开市场、便利出售股东有序分销股份，以及使我们和我们的股东能够进入公开股权市场。我们拟将本次发行的所得款项净额用于一般公司用途，包括营运资金、经营费用及资本支出（包括对算力及基础设施的投资），以及招聘和留用高技能人才。此外，我们可能将部分所得款项净额用于收购或投资业务、产品、服务或技术。然而，我们目前并无任何重大收购或投资的协议或承诺。我们亦拟将部分所得款项净额用于履行与结算若干尚未归属的限制性股票单位（“RSU”）相关的预期预扣及代缴税款义务。更多信息参见“所得款项用途”一节。</div></div></div></div></td></tr><tr style=height:3pt><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div><div class=s1-sheet style="--justify:justify;--position:absolute;background-color:#fff;border:1px solid #cccc;content-visibility:auto;float:none;font-size:0;height:792pt;margin:10px auto;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:relative;width:612pt"><div style="background-image:url(data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%20style=%22pointer-events:none%22%3E%3Cpath%20style=%22fill:transparent;stroke:%23000;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-width:1pt%22%20d=%22M48.67%2048.67V983.33H767.33V48.67H48.67%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E);background-size:612pt 792pt;height:792pt;position:absolute;width:612pt;z-index:-9223372036854775805"></div><div style=position:absolute;top:720pt><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:22.27pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:301.27pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre>19</font></div></div></div><div style=position:absolute><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:6.46pt;position:absolute;top:13.5pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.4pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.25pt;font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f"><a href=#if79d5262bb1f4e24ac84b67b9de9b345_12633 style=color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit>目录</a></span></div></div></div></div><div><div style=position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:72pt;width:612pt><div style=font-size:0;left:72pt;position:absolute;width:468pt><div><table style=border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;width:100%><tbody><tr style=height:0><td style=padding:0;width:209.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:255.75pt></td></tr><tr style=height:165.75pt><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top><div style=position:absolute;width:209.25pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:2.63pt;width:209.25pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:2.63pt;width:205.62pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">表决权</div></div></div></div></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top><div style=left:212.25pt;position:absolute;width:255.75pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:2.63pt;width:255.75pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.16pt;left:2.63pt;width:252.77pt;line-height:9.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们的A类普通股每股享有一票。除法律另有规定外，我们的N类普通股无表决权。我们的T类普通股（一股）对一般提交股东表决的事项不享有表决权，但我们经修订及重述的公司注册证书所载者（包括就选举董事会多数成员而言）或法律另有规定者除外。我们的F类普通股（一股）就一般提交股东表决的所有事项（包括选举T类董事以外的董事）将享有的合计投票数，相当于截至适用股权登记日我们发行在外股份总投票权的50.1%。我们的E类普通股就若干有限事项将享有每股一票。</div></div></div></div></td></tr><tr style=height:3pt><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td></tr><tr style=height:51.75pt><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top><div style=position:absolute;top:168.75pt;width:209.25pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:2.63pt;width:209.25pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:2.63pt;width:205.62pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">受控公司</div></div></div></div></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top><div style=left:212.25pt;position:absolute;top:168.75pt;width:255.75pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:2.63pt;width:255.75pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.16pt;left:2.63pt;width:252.78pt;line-height:9.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">根据纳斯达克全球精选市场公司治理要求的定义，我们被视为一家“受控公司”。更多信息参见“我们的治理结构及其目标”“管理层”及“股本说明”各节。</div></div></div></div></td></tr><tr style=height:3pt><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td></tr><tr style=height:42pt><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top><div style=position:absolute;top:223.5pt;width:209.25pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:2.63pt;width:209.25pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:2.63pt;width:205.62pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">风险因素</div></div></div></div></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top><div style=left:212.25pt;position:absolute;top:223.5pt;width:255.75pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:2.63pt;width:255.75pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.16pt;left:2.63pt;width:249.65pt;line-height:9.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">有关您在决定投资我们的A类普通股之前应考虑的部分因素的讨论，参见“<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f"><a href=#ica694c859b8e458dbf6a73f56dde9d42_2972 style=color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit>风险因素</a></span>”一节以及本招股说明书所载的其他信息。</div></div></div></div></td></tr><tr style=height:3pt><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td></tr><tr style=height:14.25pt><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top><div style=position:absolute;top:268.5pt;width:209.25pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:3.52pt;width:209.25pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:2.63pt;width:205.62pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">拟定交易代码</div></div></div></div></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top><div style=left:212.25pt;position:absolute;top:268.5pt;width:255.75pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:3.52pt;width:255.75pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:2.63pt;width:252.12pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">“ANT”</div></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:368.75pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.28pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">本次发行后将发行在外的A类普通股、N类普通股、T类普通股及F类普通股的股份数量，基于截至2026年9月30日发行在外的<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">          </span>股A类普通股、<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">          </span>股N类普通股、一股T类普通股及一股F类普通股，其反映了：</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:423.35pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.21pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">根据我们经修订及重述的公司注册证书的条款，紧接本次发行完成前，(i)我们全部          股发行在外的A轮、C-1轮、D-1轮、D-2轮、E-1轮、F-1轮、G-1轮及H-1轮可赎回可转换优先股自动转换为          股A类普通股，以及(ii)我们全部          股发行在外的B轮、C-2轮、D-3轮、E-2轮、E-3轮、E-4轮、E-5轮、F-2轮、G-2轮、G-3轮、G-4轮、H-2轮、H-3轮及H-4轮可赎回可转换优先股自动转换为          股N类普通股（统称“优先股转换”）；</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:500.75pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.23pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">紧接本次发行完成前将向Founder LLC发行的一股F类普通股（“F类股份发行”）；</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:532.55pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.23pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">紧接本次发行完成前，本金总额为          美元的我们尚未偿还的可转换本票转换为          股N类普通股，该等股份为本次发行完成时可向Amazon Web Services, Inc.发行且不会导致其超过适用持股上限的股份（“可转换票据转换”）；</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:598.55pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.28pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">首次公益发行，其股份(i)在法律上被视为已发行在外，(ii)在由我们的全资子公司持有期间，就会计目的而言不被视为已发行在外，且(iii)因此将不会在我们的合并财务报表中反映为已发行在外；以及</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:641.75pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.26pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">受RSU约束的          股A类普通股的净额发行，该等RSU的基于服务的归属条件已于本招股说明书日期满足，而基于业绩的归属条件将于本招股说明书构成其一部分的注册声明生效时满足，且已考虑为履行相关预计预扣及代缴税款义务而预扣受该等RSU约束的          股A类普通股的影响（按照每股          美元的假定首次公开发行价格（即本招股说明书封面所载预计</div></div></div></div><div class=s1-sheet style="--justify:justify;--position:absolute;background-color:#fff;border:1px solid #cccc;content-visibility:auto;float:none;font-size:0;height:792pt;margin:10px auto;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:relative;width:612pt"><div style="background-image:url(data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%20style=%22pointer-events:none%22%3E%3Cpath%20style=%22fill:transparent;stroke:%23000;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-width:1pt%22%20d=%22M48.67%2048.67V983.33H767.33V48.67H48.67%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E);background-size:612pt 792pt;height:792pt;position:absolute;width:612pt;z-index:-9223372036854775805"></div><div style=position:absolute;top:720pt><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:22.27pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:300.43pt;position:absolute;text-de