v style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:135.6pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.25pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">截至2026年9月30日尚未行使的可购买A类普通股的期权获行使后可发行的          股A类普通股，其加权平均行权价为每股          美元；</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:178.8pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.23pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">截至本招股说明书日期尚未归属的RSU归属及结算后可发行的          股A类普通股，但该等RSU (i)截至该日期基于服务的归属条件尚未满足，且(ii)基于业绩的归属条件（如适用）将于本招股说明书构成其一部分的注册声明生效时满足；</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:233.4pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.08pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">2026年9月30日之后就我们收购非上市公司而发行的          股A类普通股；以及</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:265.2pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.1pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">根据我们的股权激励计划预留供未来发行的          股A类普通股，包括：</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:297pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:108pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.36pt>◦</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:126pt;width:416.26pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">根据我们的捐赠匹配计划（经修订及重述，“捐赠匹配计划”）可发行的N类普通股转换后预留供未来发行的          股A类普通股；</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:340.2pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:108pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.36pt>◦</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:126pt;width:416.2pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">根据我们的2026年股权激励计划（“2026年计划”）将预留供未来发行的          股A类普通股，该计划将于本次发行完成前生效；</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:383.4pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:108pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.36pt>◦</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:126pt;width:416.27pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">截至2026年9月30日根据我们经修订及重述的2021年股票计划（“2021年计划”）预留供未来发行的          股A类普通股，该等股份数量将于2026年计划生效时加入根据2026年计划将预留供未来发行的A类普通股股份中，届时我们将停止根据2021年计划授予奖励；以及</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:449.4pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:108pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.36pt>◦</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:126pt;width:416.2pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">根据我们的2026年员工股票购买计划（“ESPP”）将预留供未来发行的          股A类普通股，该计划将于本次发行完成前生效。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:492.6pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.18pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们的2026年计划和ESPP均规定了其项下预留的A类普通股股份数量的年度自动增加，且我们的2026年计划规定，其项下可授予的股份数量可基于以下情况增加：根据2021年计划授予的奖励到期、被注销或被没收，以及2021年计划项下的股份为支付行权价格或履行预扣税款义务而向我们交付或被我们预扣，或被没收或以其他方式被我们回购，详见“高管薪酬—股权<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">计划</span>”一节。</div></div></div></div><div class=s1-sheet style="--justify:justify;--position:absolute;background-color:#fff;border:1px solid #cccc;content-visibility:auto;float:none;font-size:0;height:792pt;margin:10px auto;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:relative;width:612pt"><div style="background-image:url(data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%20style=%22pointer-events:none%22%3E%3Cpath%20style=%22fill:transparent;stroke:%23000;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-width:1pt%22%20d=%22M48.67%2048.67V983.33H767.33V48.67H48.67%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E);background-size:612pt 792pt;height:792pt;position:absolute;width:612pt;z-index:-9223372036854775805"></div><div style=position:absolute;top:720pt><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:22.27pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:301.31pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre>21</font></div></div></div><div style=position:absolute><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:6.46pt;position:absolute;top:13.5pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.4pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.25pt;font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f"><a href=#if79d5262bb1f4e24ac84b67b9de9b345_12633 style=color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit>目录</a></span></div></div></div></div><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:72pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">除另有说明外，本招股说明书中的所有信息均假定：</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:92.4pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:108pt;width:434.29pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">优先股转换将于紧接本次发行完成前进行；</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:112.8pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:108pt;width:432pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">可转换票据转换将于紧接本次发行完成前进行；</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:133.2pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.29pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们经修订及重述的公司注册证书在特拉华州的提交与生效以及我们经修订及重述的章程细则的生效，均将于紧接本次发行完成前进行；</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:176.4pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:108pt;width:432pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">F类股份发行将于紧接本次发行完成前进行；</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:196.8pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:108pt;width:432pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">本次发行完成前不会发行任何E类普通股股份；</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:217.2pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.21pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">于2026年9月17日实施的A类普通股及N类普通股的正向股票拆分（每1股拆为10股），包括我们获授权股本股份的相应比例增加，本招股说明书所列示的所有期间的全部股份、期权、RSU及每股信息均已追溯调整以反映该正向股票拆分；</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:271.8pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:108pt;width:432pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">于2026年9月17日实施的T类普通股的反向股票拆分（每1,000股合并为1股）；</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:292.2pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.23pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">除RSU结算外，2026年9月30日之后未行使任何尚未行使的股票期权或结算任何尚未归属的RSU；以及</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:324pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.21pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">承销商未行使其在本次发行中向我们额外购买最多          股A类普通股的选择权。</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=ch-summary-financial-data><h2 class=dl-ch>合并财务及其他数据概要</h2><div class=s1-sheets data-first-page=33><div class=s1-sheets-inner><div class=s1-sheet style="--justify:j