to serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">上述备考调整导致的每股增加额</div></div></div></div></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td></tr><tr style=height:14.25pt><td style=background-color:#fff;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top><div style=position:absolute;top:51.75pt;width:334.5pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:3.52pt;width:334.5pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:14.63pt;width:318.87pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">截至2026年9月30日每股备考有形账面净值</div></div></div></div></td><td style=background-color:#fff;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=background-color:#fff;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=background-color:#fff;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td></tr><tr style=height:23.25pt><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top><div style=position:absolute;top:66pt;width:334.5pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:3.02pt;width:334.5pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.16pt;left:14.63pt;width:315.5pt;line-height:9.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">在本次发行中购买A类普通股股份的新投资者导致的每股备考有形账面净值增加额</div></div></div></div></td><td style="background-color:#ecebe3;border-bottom:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td></tr><tr style=height:23.25pt><td style=background-color:#fff;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top><div style=position:absolute;top:89.25pt;width:334.5pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:3.02pt;width:334.5pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.16pt;left:2.63pt;width:329.3pt;line-height:9.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">紧接本次发行后每股经调整备考有形账面净值</div></div></div></div></td><td style="background-color:#fff;border-top:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"></td><td style=background-color:#fff;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="background-color:#fff;border-bottom:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"></td></tr><tr style=height:23.25pt><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top><div style=position:absolute;top:112.5pt;width:334.5pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:3.02pt;width:334.5pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.16pt;left:2.63pt;width:312.39pt;line-height:9.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">本次发行中新投资者的每股经调整备考有形账面净值摊薄</div></div></div></div></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="background-color:#ecebe3;border-bottom:1pt solid #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style=left:402.75pt;position:absolute;top:112.5pt;width:65.25pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:12.52pt;width:65.25pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:2.63pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre>$                     </font></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:589.55pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.28pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">上述摊薄信息仅供说明之用，可能会根据实际首次公开发行价格及本次发行的其他条款而变化。</span>假定首次公开发行价格每股<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">          </span>美元（即本招股说明书封面所载预计发行价格区间的中间值）每增加或减少1.00美元，将会使新投资者对应的每股经调整备考有形账面净值增加或减少（如适用）<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">          </span>美元，并将会使在本次发行中购买A类普通股股份的新投资者的每股摊薄增加或减少（如适用）<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">          </span>美元，前提是本招股说明书封面所载由我们发售的股份数量保持不变，并已扣除估计承销折扣及佣金以及由我们支付的估计发行费用。同样，由我们发售的A类普通股股份数量每增加或减少100万股，将会使我们的经调整备考有形账面净值增加或减少（如适用）约每股<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">          </span>美元，并使对在本次发行中购买A类普通股股份的新投资者的摊薄增加或减少（如适用）每股<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">          </span>美元，</div></div></div></div><div class=s1-sheet style="--justify:justify;--position:absolute;background-color:#fff;border:1px solid #cccc;content-visibility:auto;float:none;font-size:0;height:792pt;margin:10px auto;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:relative;width:612pt"><div style=position:absolute;top:720pt><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:22.27pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:298.42pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre>130</font></div></div></div><div style=position:absolute><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:6.46pt;position:absolute;top:13.5pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.4pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.25pt;font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f