0日止六个月的8.70亿美元增长至截至2026年6月30日止六个月的120亿美元，分别占截至2025年及2026年6月30日止六个月总收入的约75%和74%。</div></div></div></div><div class=s1-sheet style="--justify:justify;--position:absolute;background-color:#fff;border:1px solid #cccc;content-visibility:auto;float:none;font-size:0;height:792pt;margin:10px auto;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:relative;width:612pt"><div style=position:absolute;top:720pt><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:22.27pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:298.59pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre>149</font></div></div></div><div style=position:absolute><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:6.46pt;position:absolute;top:13.5pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.4pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.25pt;font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f"><a href=#if79d5262bb1f4e24ac84b67b9de9b345_12633 style=color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit>目录</a></span></div></div></div></div><div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:72pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">经营费用</div></div><div style=line-height: