-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">增加</span><span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">14亿美元</span>，增幅为<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">460%</span>。该<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">增长</span>主要是由于与数据质量及性能评估服务相关的供应商成本增加<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">2.51亿美元</span>、信息技术及云软件成本增加<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">2.23亿美元</span>、支付处理费用增加<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">2.22亿美元</span>、专业服务成本增加<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">2.05亿美元</span>、与我们的捐赠匹配计划相关的非现金费用增加<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">1.26亿美元</span>，以及设施及场地占用成本增加<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">6,800万美元</span>。</div></div></div></div><div class=s1-sheet style="--justify: