georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">190%</span>。该增长是由于根据我们在以前年度订立的CSP安排在2025年全年分批次交付已承诺算力。随着每一批次可供使用，算力及基础设施费用相应增加。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:301.1pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.28pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">与2024年相比，2025年算力及基础设施费用占收入百分比有所下降，原因是收入大幅增长，而算力基础是预先承诺的，并未随期内需求而波动。</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:344.3pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">人员</div></div><div style=position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:365.3pt;width:612pt><div style=font-size:0;left:72pt;position:absolute;width:468pt><div><table style=border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;width:100%><tbody><tr style=height:0><td style=padding:0;width:198pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td></tr><tr style=height:12pt><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top" colspan=3