.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">5.25</span>亿美元，增幅为<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">1,221%</span>。该增长主要是由于向渠道合作伙伴支付的费用增加3.41亿美元（反映了我们业务的增长），以及营销和广告费用增加1.70亿美元（反映了为支持产品发布而增加的媒体及公共关系支出）。</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:138pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">其他经营及行政</div></div><div style=position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:159pt;width:612pt><div style=font-size:0;left:72pt;position:absolute;width:468pt><div><table style=border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;width:100%><tbody><tr style=height:0><td style=padding:0;width:198pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td></tr><tr style=height:12pt><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top" colspan=3><div style=left:198pt;position:absolute;width:133.5pt><div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;top:2.72pt;width:133.5pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;left:0;width:133.5pt;line-height:10pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;color:#000;text-indent:0;text-align:center;