pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:9.43pt>(1)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.78pt;left:90pt;width:451.83pt;line-height:9.6pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">与我们的捐赠匹配计划产生的非现金费用相关，该等费用的价值与员工股权奖励挂钩，并计入其他经营及行政费用。</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:291.35pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:10.46pt>(2)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;left:90pt;width:450pt;line-height:10pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">由于不能反映持续经营情况，因此未纳入我们经调整经营利润（亏损）的计算。</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:309.95pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">经调整净利润（亏损）</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:330.95pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.