 style=color:#000;font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre><font style=left:23.55pt;position:absolute></font><font style=left:23.55pt;position:absolute>(810)</font><font style=left:46.24pt;position:absolute>%</font></font></div></div></div></td><td style=background-color:#fff;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="background-color:#fff;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style=left:235.5pt;position:absolute;top:341.25pt;width:59.25pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:3.52pt;width:59.25pt><font style=color:#000;font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre><font style=left:27.53pt;position:absolute></font><font style=left:27.53pt;position:absolute>(878)</font><font style=left:50.74pt;position:absolute>%</font></font></div></div></div></td><td style=background-color:#fff;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="background-color:#fff;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style=left:297.75pt;position:absolute;top:341.25pt;width:54.75pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:3.52pt;width:54.75pt><font style=color:#000;font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre><font style=left:22.79pt;position:absolute></font><font style=left:22.79pt;position:absolute>(826)</font><font style=left:46.239999999999995pt;position:absolute>%</font></font></div></div></div></td><td style=background-color:#fff;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="background-color:#fff;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style=left:355.5pt;position:absolute;top:341.25pt;width:54.75pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:3.52pt;width:54.75pt><font style=color:#000;font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre><font style=left:23.04pt;position:absolute></font><font style=left:23.04pt;position:absolute>(305)</font><font style=left:46.239999999999995pt;position:absolute>%</font></font></div></div></div></td><td style=background-color:#fff;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="background-color:#fff;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style=left:413.25pt;position:absolute;top:341.25pt;width:54.75pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:3.52pt;width:54.75pt><font style=color:#000;font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre><font style=left:23.98pt;position:absolute></font><font style=left:23.98pt;position:absolute>(574)</font><font style=left:46.24pt;position:absolute>%</font></font></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:453.5pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:71.96pt>______________</font></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:463.1pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:10pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">注：占收入百分比的合计数因四舍五入可能无法加总。</div></div><div id=ica694c859b8e458dbf6a73f56dde9d42_1472 style=position:absolute;top:481.7pt></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:9.07pt;position:absolute;top:481.7pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.96pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:15pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">季度趋势</div></div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:505.1pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">收入</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:526.1pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.28pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">在所列报的各个季度中，收入逐季环比增长，从<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">截至2025年3月31日止三个月</span>的<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">3.76亿美元</span>增长至<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">截至2026年6月30日止三个月</span>的<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">116亿美元</span>。各季度的增长是由于接连推出的模型和产品带动了我们各项产品与服务的使用量提升、使用范围扩大和更广泛的采用，按用量计费收入和订阅收入均对此有所贡献。贡献可观收入的客户的增长在各期间均促成了收入增长：按过去十二个月计算贡献收入10万美元或以上的客户从<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">截至2025年3月31日的约400家</span>增长至截至<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">2026年6月30日</span>的<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">6,000</span>余家。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:614.9pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">经营费用</div></div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:635.9pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">算力及基础设施</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:656.9pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.24pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">在所列报的各个季度中，算力及基础设施费用逐季环比增长，从<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">截至2025年3月31日止三个月</span>的<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">9.44亿美元</span>增长至<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">截至2026年6月30日止三个月</span>的<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">56亿美元</span>，这是由于根据我们的多年期CSP安排交付已承诺算力所致。由于我们通常在算力可用前12至18个月进行采购，这些费用在短期内通常是固定的，并随着已承诺算力可供我们使用而增加，而非随期内需求而变化。</div></div></div></div><div class=s1-sheet style="--justify:justify;--position:absolute;background-color:#fff;border:1px solid #cccc;content-visibility:auto;float:none;font-size:0;height:792pt;margin:10px auto;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:relative;width:612pt"><div style=position:absolute;top:720pt><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:22.27pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:298.77pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre>159</font></div></div></div><div style=position:absolute><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:6.46pt;position:absolute;top:13.5pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.4pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.25pt;font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f"><a href=#if79d5262bb1f4e24ac84b67b9de9b345_12633 style=color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit>目录</a></span></div></div></div></div><div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:72pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.19pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">同期，算力及基础设施费用占收入百分比从<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">251%</span>下降至<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">48%</span>，原因是收入增长超过了我们已承诺算力成本基础的增长。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:103.8pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">人员</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:124.8pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.18pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">在所列报的各个季度中，人员费用逐季环比增长，这是由于员工人数增长及相关薪酬（包括股权激励）的增加所致。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:156.6pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">Bartz和解费用</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:177.6pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.19pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">在截至2025年9月30日止三个月内，我们就Bartz诉讼的和解计提了<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">15亿美元</span>的费用。参见载于本招股说明书其他部分的我们合并财务报表附注13。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:209.4pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">销售、营销及合作伙伴</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:230.4pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.19pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">在所列报的各个季度中，销售、营销及合作伙伴费用逐季环比增长，其中<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">截至2026年3月31日</span>和<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">2026年6月30日</span>止三个月的增幅最为显著。该等增长主要是由于向渠道合作伙伴支付的费用增加（反映了我们业务的增长），以及营销和广告费用增加（反映了为支持产品发布而增加的媒体支出）。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:285pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">其他经营及行政</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:306pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.29pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">在所列报的各个季度中，其他经营及行政费用有所增加<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">，但截至2026年3月31日止三个月除外，该季度的捐赠匹配计划费用低于截至2025年12月31日止三个月。</span>整体增长反映了随着我们业务规模扩大，与数据质量及性能评估服务相关的供应商成本、信息技术及云软件成本、支付处理及平台费用以及专业服务成本的增加。截至<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">2025年12月31日</span>止三个月的增长主要是由于与我们的捐赠匹配计划相关的非现金费用。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:383.4pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">经营利润（亏损）</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:404.4pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.29pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们的<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">经营亏损</span>在截至2025年6月30日止三个月有所扩大，主要是由于根据我们的CSP安排交付了额外的已承诺算力，相关费用在该期间的增速超过了我们的收入增速；在截至2025年9月30日止三个月亦有所扩大，该期间包括Bartz和解费用。由于收入增长超过了经营费用合计的增长，我们的经营亏损在截至2025年12月31日及2026年3月31日止三个月有所收窄，并在<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">截至2026年6月30日止三个月</span>实现了<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">10亿美元</span>的经营利润。<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">我们预计我们的经营业绩将继续逐季波动，尤其是因为我们获得的增量算力数量以及我们产生的相关费用可能因期间不同而有所变化。</span></div></div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:504.6pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">利息收入</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:525.6pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.18pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">在所列报的各个季度中，利息收入逐季环比增长，从截至2025年3月31日止三个月的<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">5,100万美元</span>增长至<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">截至2026年6月30日止三个月</span>的<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">7.62亿美元</span>，主要是由于现金及现金等价物和短期投资平均余额增加。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:568.8pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">可转换票据、衍生负债及SAFE的公允价值变动</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:589.8pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.27pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">在所列报的各个季度中，我们的可转换票据、衍生负债及SAFE的公允价值变动均产生了费用，主要是由于在各期间内我们的企业估值上升导致我们发行在外的可转换本票的公允价值增加。该项费用在<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">截至2026年6月30日止三个月</span>最高，反映了与我们的H轮融资相关的企业估值上升。我们将继续确认公允价值变动，直至这些工具转换为股权、获得偿还或以其他方式结算。参见载于本招股说明书其他部分的我们合并财务报表附注4和附注9。</div></div></div></div><div class=s1-sheet style="--justify:justify;--position:absolute;background-color:#fff;border:1px solid #cccc;content-visibility:auto;float:none;font-size:0;height:792pt;margin:10px auto;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:relative;width:612pt"><div style=position:absolute;top:720pt><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:22.27pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:298.36pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre>160</font></div></div></div><div style=position:absolute><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:6.46pt;position:absolute;top:13.5pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.4pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.25pt;font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f"><a href=#if79d5262bb1f4e24ac84b67b9de9b345_12633 style=color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit>目录</a></span></div></div></div></div><div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:72pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">其他收入（费用）净额</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:93pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.29pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">在2026年之前所列报的各个季度中，其他收入（费用）净额并不重大。<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">截至2026年3月31日</span>和<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">2026年6月30日</span>止三个月的其他收入（费用）净额分别为<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">-3.09亿美元</span>和<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">-84亿美元</span>，主要是由于根据票据购买协议确认的资产和负债的初始公允价值确认及其后的公允价值变动。参见载于本招股说明书其他部分的我们合并财务报表附注4。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:159pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">所得税费用</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:180pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">所得税费用在所列报的各个季度中并不重大。</div></div><div id=ica694c859b8e458dbf6a73f56dde9d42_19791209303747 style=position:absolute;top:200.4pt></div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:200.4pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-he