align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:285.8pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:9.43pt>(1)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.77pt;left:90pt;width:451.84pt;line-height:9.6pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">如果Google行使其选择权，在与本次发行同时进行的私募配售中按公开发行价格购买我们的N类普通股股份，则可能被削减最多100亿美元。更多信息参见“—Google”一节。</div></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:314.6pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:10.46pt>(2)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.77pt;left:90pt;width:451.81pt;line-height:9.6pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">本次发行完成后30个月，或在与Amazon的若干商业协议终止时提前截止。</div></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:333.8pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:10.41pt>(3)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.77pt;left:90pt;width:451.9pt;line-height:9.6pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">经我们同意（我们不得无理拒绝同意），Broadcom可将基础设施合作伙伴2026 NPA转让给指定财务合作伙伴。</div></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:353pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:10.51pt>(4)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.78pt;left:90pt;width:451.77pt;line-height:9.6pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">自提款期开始起五年，但可提前终止。更多信息参见“—Broadcom”一节。</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:381.2pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">Amazon</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:402.2pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.28pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">下表概述了Amazon 2026 NPA的主要条款，该协议规定在受下文所述限制的前提下，未来可能发行可转换本票。如上文“—未偿票据”一节所述，由于Amazon的持股上限，根据Amazon 2023 NPA和Amazon 2024 NPA发行的票据先前已转换为不计息展期票据。</div></div><div style=position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last: