r:#ecebe3;border-top:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style=left:364.5pt;position:absolute;top:47.25pt;width:50.25pt><div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;top:2.63pt;width:50.25pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;left:2.63pt;width:46.62pt;line-height:10pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">不适用<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;position:relative;top:-2.117pt">(3)</span></div></div></div></div></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="background-color:#ecebe3;border-top:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style=left:417.75pt;position:absolute;top:47.25pt;width:50.25pt><div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;top:2.63pt;width:50.25pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.78pt;left:2.63pt;width:44.29pt;line-height:9.6pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">持有人可选择将任何未偿票据按相当于我们A类普通股前30日成交量加权平均价格90%的转换价格转换为我们的N类普通股股份<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;position:relative;top:-2.117pt">(4)</span></div></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:566pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:71.96pt>______________</font></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:575.6pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:9.43pt>(1)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;left:90pt;width:450pt;line-height:10pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">截至2026年6月30日。</div></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:585.2pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:10.46pt>(2)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.77pt;left:90pt;width:451.9pt;line-height:9.6pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">经我们同意（我们不得无理拒绝同意），Broadcom可将基础设施合作伙伴2026 NPA转让给指定财务合作伙伴。</div></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:604.4pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:10.41pt>(3)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;left:90pt;width:451.92pt;line-height:10pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们预计在本次发行完成之前不会根据基础设施合作伙伴2026 NPA发行任何票据。</div></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:614pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:10.51pt>(4)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.78pt;left:90pt;width:451.84pt;line-height:9.6pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">票据利息通过将应计利息资本化计入本金以实物方式支付。在若干收入业绩条件未达成的期间内发行的任何票据，按13.00%的年利率计息，并按适用价格的85%（而非90%）转换。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:651.8pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.27pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们可在需要时根据基础设施合作伙伴2026 NPA发行票据，期限截至提款期开始（提款期尚未开始，将在基础设施设备根据2026年租赁安排的条款可投入使用时开始）后的第五个周年日，但在某些情况下可提前终止，且所发行票据仅用于为2026年租赁安排项下的季度租金付款提供资金。我们根据基础设施合作伙伴2026 NPA发行票据的能力须满足多项条件，包括若干收入增长率条件（这些条件显著低于我们在2025年所有</div></div></div></div><div class=s1-sheet style="--justify:justify;--position:absolute;background-color:#fff;border:1px solid #cccc;content-visibility:auto;float:none;font-size:0;height:792pt;margin:10px auto;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:relative;width:612pt"><div style=position:absolute;top:720pt><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:22.27pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:298.89pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre>167</font></div></div></div><div style=position:absolute><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:6.46pt;position:absolute;top:13.5pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.4pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.25pt;font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f"><a href=#if79d5262bb1f4e24ac84b67b9de9b345_12633 style=color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit>目录</a></span></div></div></div></div><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:72pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.28pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">季度及2026年迄今的实际收入增长率）、我们持续遵守A&amp;R信贷融资项下的最低流动性要求，以及我们持续履行租赁安排（定义见下文）项下的义务，而且如果这些条件在持续一段时间内未获满足，我们发行这些票据的能力即告终止。我们在票据项下的义务由我们的若干子公司提供担保，并且连同该等担保，以为2026年租赁安排提供担保的担保品作次级顺位担保。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:138pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.29pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">如果我们选择提前买断租赁设备，或者如果Broadcom或指定财务合作伙伴要求根据2026年租赁安排支付约定损失赔付，则Broadcom或指定财务合作伙伴可要求我们以现金或按上述转换价格以我们的N类普通股股份结算部分票据。如果我们发生控制权变更或类似清算事件，Broadcom或指定财务合作伙伴可选择收取相当于票据当时未偿本金额及应计利息150%的现金，或在该清算交易交割前即刻转换该等票据。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:226.8pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.25pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">基础设施合作伙伴2026 NPA包含惯常的违约事件，包括租赁安排项下的付款违约以及对重大债务的交叉违约；一旦发生违约事件，持有票据的Broadcom或指定财务合作伙伴可宣布任何未偿票据加速到期，并终止任何剩余承诺。就基础设施合作伙伴2026 NPA而言，我们与Broadcom就票据转换时发行的任何N类普通股股份订立了一份注册权协议。参见“股本说明—注册权”一节。</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:304.2pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">Google</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:325.2pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.18pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">下表概述了Google 2026 NPA的主要条款，该协议规定在受下文所述限制的前提下，未来可能发行票据。</div></div><div style=position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:357pt;width:612pt><div style=font-size:0;left:72pt;position:absolute;width:468pt><div><table style=border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;width:100%><tbody><tr style=height:0><td style=padding:0;width:95.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:50.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:50.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:50.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:50.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:50.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:50.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:50.25pt></td></tr><tr style=height:12pt><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top" colspan=3><div style=left:364.5pt;position:absolute;width:103.5pt><div><div style=line-height:4.53pt;position:absolute;top:4.67pt;width:103.5pt