/div></div></div></div></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="background-color:#ecebe3;border-top:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style=left:364.5pt;position:absolute;top:47.25pt;width:50.25pt><div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;top:2.63pt;width:50.25pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;left:2.63pt;width:46.62pt;line-height:10pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">不适用<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;position:relative;top:-2.117pt">(2)</span></div></div></div></div></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="background-color:#ecebe3;border-top:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style=left:417.75pt;position:absolute;top:47.25pt;width:50.25pt><div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;top:2.63pt;width:50.25pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-.98pt;left:2.63pt;width:46.1pt;line-height:8pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">对于首次公开发行后的提款，Google可选择收取(i)条款有待共同商定的可转换本票，或(ii)按我们A类普通股前30日成交量加权平均价格发行的我们的N类普通股股份。<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;position:relative;top:-2.117pt">(3)</span></div></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:613.25pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:71.96pt>______________</font></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:622.85pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:9.43pt>(1)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;left:90pt;width:450pt;line-height:10pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">截至2026年6月30日。</div></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:632.45pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:10.46pt>(2)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.77pt;left:90pt;width:451.81pt;line-height:9.6pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们预计在本次发行完成之前不会根据Google 2026 NPA发行任何金额。如果Google选择在本次发行后收取任何可转换本票，其条款将由我们与Google共同商定。参见“首次公开发行后”一栏。</div></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:661.25pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:10.41pt>(3)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.78pt;left:90pt;width:451.8pt;line-height:9.6pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">如果我们与Google无法就可转换本票的条款达成一致，则该次提款将以我们A类普通股的前30日成交量加权平均价格发行N类普通股股份的方式结算。</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:689.45pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.25pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">根据Google 2026 NPA<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400">提出票据发行申请</span>的期限截至2030年12月31日，且该等申请以若干第三方算力协议项下若干条件的达成以及特定的</div></div></div></div><div class=s1-sheet style="--justify:justify;--position:absolute;background-color:#fff;border:1px solid #cccc;content-visibility:auto;float:none;font-size:0;height:792pt;margin:10px auto;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:relative;width:612pt"><div style=position:absolute;top:720pt><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:22.27pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:298.44pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre>168</font></div></div></div><div style=position:absolute><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:6.46pt;position:absolute;top:13.5pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.4pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.25pt;font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f"><a href=#if79d5262bb1f4e24ac84b67b9de9b345_12633 style=color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit>目录</a></span></div></div></div></div><div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:72pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.29pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">过去十二个月（TTM）收入目标（我们历来均已超过这些目标）的实现为触发条件。除非Google选择在单次交割中提供资金，否则每次票据发行分五次季度交割提供资金，且Google可选择推迟为与收入挂钩的提款提供资金。Google的持股上限限制根据Google 2026 NPA发行股份，以该等发行不会导致Google对我们的持股按投后、按转换后基准（依照Google 2026 NPA的条款计算）超过我们已发行资本总额的14.99%为限，除非Google自行决定放弃该上限；如果无法在不超过该持股上限的情况下发行股份，超出部分将通过不计息展期票据提供资金，该展期票据自发行起10年到期，可在每个财政季度末转换为N类普通股，任何未转换余额须于到期时以现金支付。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:183.6pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.27pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">就Google 2026 NPA而言，我们授予Google一项选择权，可在与本次发行同时进行的私募配售中按公开发行价格购买最多100亿美元的我们的N类普通股，如果该选择权获行使，Google 2026 NPA项下可发行的票据金额将会相应减少。我们还与Google订立了一份注册权协议。参见“股本说明—注册权”一节。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:249.6pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">现金流量</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:270.6pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">下表列示了所示期间我们现金流量的概要：</div></div><div style=position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:291pt;width:612pt><div style=font-size:0;left:72pt;position:absolute;width:468pt><div><table style=border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;width:100%><tbody><tr style=height:0><td style=padding:0;width:156pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:60pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:60pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:60pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:60pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:60pt></td></tr><tr style=height:12pt><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top" colspan=5><div style=left:156pt;p