le=display:inline-block;height:7.18pt;width:50.17pt></font></font><font style=left:52.800000000000004pt;position:absolute>—<font style=display:inline-block;height:7.18pt;width:3.56pt></font></font></font></div></div></div></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top><div style=left:402.75pt;position:absolute;top:86.25pt;width:65.25pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:3.52pt;width:65.25pt><font style=color:#000;font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre><font style=left:2.63pt;position:absolute><font style=display:inline-block;height:7.18pt;width:50.17pt></font></font><font style=left:52.800000000000004pt;position:absolute>—<font style=display:inline-block;height:7.18pt;width:3.56pt></font></font></font></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:388.1pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:71.96pt>______________</font></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:397.7pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:9.43pt>(1)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;left:90pt;width:450pt;line-height:10pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">截至2025年12月31日，我们的非雇员董事均未持有任何尚未行使/尚未归属的股权奖励。</div></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:407.3pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:10.46pt>(2)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;left:90pt;width:450pt;line-height:10pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">Kreps先生于2026年5月辞去我们的董事会职务。</div></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:416.9pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:10.41pt>(3)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;left:90pt;width:450pt;line-height:10pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">Liddell先生于2026年2月加入我们的董事会。</div></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:426.5pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:10.51pt>(4)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;left:90pt;width:450pt;line-height:10pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">Narasimhan博士于2026年4月加入我们的董事会。</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:445.1pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:467.91pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">在本次发行之前，我们并无有关就非雇员董事担任董事所提供服务而应付薪酬的正式政策。</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:476.9pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">非雇员董事薪酬政策</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:497.9pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.28pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">2026年9月，我们的董事会采纳且我们的股东批准了一项针对非雇员董事的正式薪酬政策（“董事薪酬政策”），该政策将于本招股说明书构成其一部分的注册声明生效日期的前一日生效。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:552.5pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.29pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">董事薪酬政策生效后，每位非雇员董事将因其提供的董事会服务获得下述现金和股权薪酬。我们还将为非雇员董事报销出席董事会和委员会会议所产生的合理、惯常且有适当凭证的差旅费用。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:607.1pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">现金薪酬</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:628.1pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">非雇员董事将有权就其服务获得以下现金薪酬：</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:648.5pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:108pt;width:432pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">担任董事会成员，每年100,000美元；</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:668.9pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:108pt;width:432pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">担任董事会非执行主席（如适用），每年75,000美元；</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:689.3pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:108pt;width:432pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">担任首席独立董事（如适用），每年60,000美元；</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:709.7pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:108pt;width:432pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">担任审计委员会主席，每年40,000美元；</div></div></div></div><div class=s1-sheet style="--justify:justify;--position:absolute;background-color:#fff;border:1px solid #cccc;content-visibility:auto;float:none;font-size:0;height:792pt;margin:10px auto;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:relative;width:612pt"><div style=position:absolute;top:720pt><div style=width:468pt><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:22.27pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:298.01pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre>262</font></div></div></div><div style=position:absolute><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:6.46pt;position:absolute;top:13.5pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.4pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.25pt;font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f"><a href=#if79d5262bb1f4e24ac84b67b9de9b345_12633 style=color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit>目录</a></span></div></div></div></div><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:72pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:108pt;width:432pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">担任审计委员会成员，每年20,000美元；</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:92.4pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:108pt;width:432pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">担任薪酬委员会主席，每年30,000美元；</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:112.8pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:108pt;width:432pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">担任薪酬委员会成员，每年15,000美元；</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:133.2pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:108pt;width:432pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">担任NGC主席，每年30,000美元；以及</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:153.6pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:108pt;width:432pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">担任NGC成员，每年15,000美元<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400">。</span></div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:174pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.19pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">担任委员会主席的每位非雇员董事将仅获得作为该委员会主席的额外年费，而不会同时获得作为该委员会成员的额外年费。支付给非雇员董事的所有现金款项将按比例按季度后付。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:217.2pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">股权薪酬</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:238.2pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.28pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400">年度奖励。</span>自2027年起，每位非雇员董事将于每届股东年度大会召开之日自动获授一项价值325,000美元（“年度奖励授予价值”）的RSU奖励（“年度奖励”），该价值将依照当时有效的公司标准做法，采用与根据公司股权授予政策（以董事会或已获授予适当权限的董事会委员会最近批准的版本为准）适用于雇员股权奖励相同的方法，转换为若干股A类普通股（“转换方法”）。年度奖励将在其授予日之后的每个季度归属日（定义见下文）分四期等额按季度归属，但无论如何，年度奖励将在其授予日之后的下一届股东年度大会召开日期的前一日全部归属，前提是该非雇员董事直至适用的归属日持续为我们提供服务。“季度归属日”是指某一年度的2月20日、5月20日、8月20日和11月20日。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:384pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.22pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400">初始奖励及按比例年度奖励。</span>在董事薪酬政策生效日期之后首次成为非雇员董事的每位人士将自动获授：</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:415.8pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.16pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">一项价值为400,000美元的RSU奖励，该价值将按转换方法折算为该奖励所涉及的A类普通股股数（“初始奖励”）；及</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:459pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.26pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">一项RSU奖励，其价值等于年度奖励授予价值乘以以下分数：以(A)自该人士首次成为非雇员董事之日起至我们当时最近一次股东年度大会召开之日的一周年止期间内的完整月份数，除以(B)12，所得的分数；该价值将按转换方法折算为该奖励所涉及的A类普通股股数（“按比例年度奖励”）。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:536.4pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.28pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">每项初始奖励及按比例年度奖励的授予将于该人士首次成为非雇员董事之日（该日期称为“初始起始日”）当日或之后的首个交易日生效。如某人士为董事会成员且同时为雇员，则其因终止雇佣而成为非雇员董事的，该非雇员董事无权获得初始奖励或按比例年度奖励。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:602.4pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.29pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">初始奖励将按以下方式归属：12.5%的RSU将于归属起始日（定义见下文）满六个月之日归属，其余RSU将于此后每个季度归属日分14期等额逐季归属，前提是该非雇员董事直至适用的归属日期持续为我们提供服务。“归属起始日”指初始起始日当日或之后的首个季度归属日。按比例年度奖励将在初始起始日至以下两者中较早者之间的每个季度归属日等额分期归属：(i)按比例年度奖励授予日之后召开的我们下一次股东年度大会，或(ii)我们最近一次股东年度大会的一周年之日；但无论如何，按比例年度奖励将于其授予日之后召开的我们下一次股东年度大会召开日的前一日全部归属（为明确起见，每个上述</div></div></div></div><div class=s1-sheet style="--justify:justify;--position:absolute;background-color:#fff;border:1px solid #cccc;content-visibility:auto;float:none;font-size:0;height:792pt;margin:10px auto;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:relative;width:612pt"><div style=position:absolute;top:720pt><div style=width:468pt><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:22.27pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:298.04pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre>263</font></div></div></div><div style=position:absolute><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:6.46pt;position:absolute;top:13.5pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.4pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.25pt;font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f"><a href=#if79d5262bb1f4e24ac84b67b9de9b345_12633 style=color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit>目录</a></span></div></div></div></div><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:72pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.29pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">季度归属日以及于我们下一次股东年度大会召开日或我们最近一次股东年度大会一周年之日（如适用）的前一日发生的最终归属日，均将计为一期，因此，如有两个上述季度归属日，则按比例年度奖励应分三期等额归属），前提是该非雇员董事直至适用的归属日期持续为我们提供服务。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:138pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">控制权变更</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:159pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.29pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">如发生“控制权变更”（定义见我们的2026年计划），每位非雇员董事根据董事薪酬政策依据我们的2026年计划获授的尚未归属的股权奖励（包括任何初始奖励、按比例年度奖励或年度奖励）将全部归属，前提是该非雇员董事截至该日期仍持续担任非雇员董事。</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=ch-executive-compensation><h2 class=dl-ch>高管薪酬</h2><div class=s1-sheets data-first-page=275><div class=s1-sheets-inner><div class=s1-sheet style="--justify:justify;--position:absolute;background-color:#fff;border:1px solid #cccc;content-visibility:auto;float:none;font-size:0;height:792pt;margin:10px auto;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:relative;width:612pt"><div style=position:absolute;top:720pt><div style=width:468pt><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:22.27pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:297.98pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre>264</font></div></div></div><div style=position:absolute><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:6.46pt;position:absolute;top:13.5pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.4pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.25pt;font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f"><a href=#if79d5262bb1f4e24ac84b67b9de9b345_12633 style=color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit>目录</a></span></div></div></div></div><div><div id=ica694c859b8e458dbf6a73f56dde9d42_9895604651152 style=position:absolute;top:72pt></div><div style=font-size:20pt;line-height:14.36pt;position:absolute;top:72pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-5.32pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:25pt;font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:20pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><a id=i747d345951b64c25972eda4b13dc06c4_60167></a>高管薪酬</div></div><div style=line-height:9.07pt;position:absolute;top:105pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.96pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:15pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">薪酬讨论与分析</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:128.4pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.28pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">本薪酬讨论与分析（“CD&amp;A”）一节旨在讨论我们的薪酬理念、我们的高管薪酬计划以及我们指定高管（“NEO”）的薪酬。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:171.6pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">截至2025年12月31日止年度，我们的指定高管为：</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:192pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:108pt;width:432pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">Dario Amodei，我们的首席执行官、联合创始人兼董事；</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:212.4pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:108pt;width:432pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">Daniela Amodei，我们的总裁、联合创始人兼董事；及</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:232.8pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:108pt;width:432pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">Krishna Rao，我们的首席财务官。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:253.2pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.29pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">本讨论包含基于我们对未来薪酬计划的当前规划、考量、预期及决定作出的前瞻性陈述。另请参见“关于前瞻性陈述的特别说明”一节。我们未来采纳的实际薪酬计划可能与本讨论所概述的当前拟定计划存在重大差异。有关指定高管薪酬计划及向其提供的薪酬的更多信息，参见“—财年结束后的薪酬变动及股权奖励”一节。</div></div><div style=line-height:9.07pt;position:absolute;top:330.6pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.96pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:15pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">执行摘要</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:354pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.28pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">在Anthropic，我们致力于打造一支认同我们使命和价值观的团队。高管薪酬体现了我们的整体薪酬理念，该理念优先考虑以AI开发市场第90百分位为目标的有竞争力的薪酬、同一岗位、职级和地点的薪酬一致性以及计划设计的简洁性。2025年，我们提供了由基本工资、长期股权激励奖励（包括股票期权和RSU）及其他福利构成的有竞争力的薪酬组合，以在竞争激烈的市场环境中吸引并留住顶尖人才。</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:420pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">薪酬理念与目标</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:441pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.29pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们的高管薪酬理念是，对同一岗位、职级和地点的高级管理人员提供一致的现金和股权薪酬。在确定高管薪酬时，我们会对照特定岗位和职级的市场数据审视每位高管的现有薪酬。我们每年进行两次此类审视，作为我们绩效与薪酬周期的一部分，在此周期中我们会审查针对高管拟议的基于市场和基于晋升的现金及股权增幅。我们计划继续定期审视并可能调整我们的高管薪酬计划，以确保其在我们作为上市公司期间与我们的薪酬理念保持一致。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:529.8pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.27pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">在确定高级领导者的薪酬时，我们将七位联合创始人（其中仅Amodei博士和Amodei女士为高级管理人员）与并非联合创始人的其他高级领导者（其中仅Rao先生为高级管理人员）区分开来。每位联合创始人获得同等薪酬。作为非联合创始人的高级领导者，Rao先生根据其岗位和职级的市场数据获得基本工资和股权薪酬。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:595.8pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.27pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们的高管薪酬计划旨在实现下述目标。我们定期审视高管薪酬计划，以评估其是否实现上述目标并适应不断变化的经济状况。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:639pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.28pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">以有竞争力的薪酬吸引并留住顶尖人才。</span>我们针对各岗位、地点和职级向高管提供有竞争力的现金和股权薪酬，以吸引认同使命的顶尖高管人才。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:673.8pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.29pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">内部公平。</span>我们在确定高管薪酬时考虑内部公平。作为联合创始人，Amodei博士和Amodei女士获授同等薪酬，包括任何年度现金或股权增幅。作为非联合创始人的高级领导者，Rao先生的薪酬依据我们同业对标组中针对其岗位、职级和地点的市场</div></div></div></div><div class=s1-sheet style="--justify:justify;--position:absolute;background-color:#fff;border:1px solid #cccc;content-visibility:auto;float:none;font-size:0;height:792pt;margin:10px auto;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:relative;width:612pt"><div style=position:absolute;top:720pt><div style=width:468pt><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:22.27pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:298.16pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre>265</font></div></div></div><div style=position:absolute><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:6.46pt;position:absolute;top:13.5pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.4pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.25pt;font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f"><a href=#if79d5262bb1f4e24ac84b67b9de9b345_12633 style=color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit>目录</a></span></div></div></div></div><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:72pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.22pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">数据确定。我们每年两次审视市场数据，并根据需要调整我们的薪酬基准。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:103.8pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.27pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">使高管利益与股东利益保持一致。</span>我们通过随时间推移归属的长期股权奖励提供激励，力求使高管的利益与股东的利益保持一致。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:147pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">薪酬治理要点</div></div><div style=position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:168pt;width:612pt><div style=font-size:0;left:72pt;position:absolute;width:468pt><div><table style=border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;width:100%><tbody><tr style=height:0><td style=padding:0;width:15pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:217.5pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:15pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:217.5pt></td></tr><tr style=height:12pt><td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top" colspan=2><div style=position:absolute;width:232.5pt><div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;top:2.63pt;width:232.5pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;left:0;width:232.5pt;line-height:10pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;color:#000;text-indent:0;text-align:center;text-align-last:center;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们的做法：</div></div></div></div></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-ali