orgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:7pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;color:#000;text-indent:-3.87pt;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">期权奖励的行权价或基准价（美元/股）</div></div></div></div></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style=left:402.75pt;position:absolute;top:32.25pt;width:65.25pt><div><div style=line-height:5.29pt;position:absolute;top:10.95pt;width:65.25pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-.85pt;left:9.25pt;width:46.74pt;line-height:7pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:7pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:3.58pt;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">股票及期权奖励的授予日公允价值（美元）<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:4.55pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;position:relative;top:-1.852pt">(3)</span></div></div></div></div></td></tr><tr style=height:12pt><td style="background-color:#ecebe3;border-top:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style=position:absolute;top:79.5pt;width:120.75pt><div><div style=line-height:6.8pt;position:absolute;top:2.63pt;width:120.75pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.23pt;left:2.63pt;width:117.12pt;line-height:11.25pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">Dario Amodei</div></div></div></div></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;verti