 style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:22.27pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:298.34pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre>273</font></div></div></div><div style=position:absolute><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:6.46pt;position:absolute;top:13.5pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.4pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.25pt;font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f"><a href=#if79d5262bb1f4e24ac84b67b9de9b345_12633 style=color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit>目录</a></span></div></div></div></div><div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:72pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:10.46pt>(2)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.77pt;left:90pt;width:451.9pt;line-height:9.6pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">这些奖励反映了RSU的授予，该等RSU同时受基于服务的归属条件和基于业绩的归属条件约束，RSU须同时满足上述两项条件方可归属，如上文“—高管薪酬的构成要素—长期股权激励计划”一节所述。RSU未设“门槛”或“最高”达成水平，因此相应栏目已予省略。</div></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:110.4pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:10.41pt>(3)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.77pt;left:90pt;width:451.85pt;line-height:9.6pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">所报告金额为根据FASB ASC第718号主题计算的授予指定高管的RSU或期权的授予日公允价值总额。该等金额并不反映每位指定高管可能实现的实际经济价值。确定本栏所报告的RSU或期权（如适用）授予日公允价值时所采用的假设，列示于本招股说明书其他部分所载我们合并财务报表的附注10。</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:9.07pt;position:absolute;top:157.8pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.96pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:15pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">2025年末未行使/未归属股权奖励</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:181.2pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.2pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">下表列出了截至2025年12月31日我们的指定高管所持<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">尚未行使/尚未归属</span>股权奖励的相关信息：</div></div><div style=position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:213pt;width:6