text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">所有奖励均根据我们的2021年计划授予，其条款载于下文“—股权计划—经修订及重述的2021年股票计划”一节。</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:408.05pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:10.46pt>(2)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;left:90pt;width:450pt;line-height:10pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">所报告金额系基于截至2025年12月31日我们A类普通股每股17.66美元的公允市场价值。</div></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:417.65pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:10.41pt>(3)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.78pt;left:90pt;width:451.82pt;line-height:9.6pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">该期权所涉股份总数的1/12<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;position:relative;top:-2.117pt"></span>于归属起始日（2025年1月1日）满一个月时归属，此后股份总数的1/12<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;position:relative;top:-2.117pt"></span>按月等额分期归属，前提是该指定高管直至每个适用归属日持续为本公司提供服务。</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:446.45pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:10.51pt>(4)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.78pt;left:90pt;width:451.78pt;line-height:9.6pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">该期权所涉股份总数的1/4<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;position:relative;top:-2.117pt"></span>于归属起始日（2024年4月18日）满一周年时归属，此后股份总数的1/48<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;position:relative;top:-2.117pt"></span>将按月等额分期归属，前提是该指定高管直至每个适用归属日持续为本公司提供服务。</div></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:475.25pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:10.22pt>(5)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.78pt;left:90pt;width:451.83pt;line-height:9.6pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">该等RSU于基于服务的条件和基于业绩的条件均获满足的首个日期归属。基于服务的条件于归属起始日（2024年11月20日）满15个月时就该等RSU的1/12<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;position:relative;top:-2.117pt"></span>获得满足，此后每满三个月就相同比例获得满足，前提是该指定高管直至每个适用的基于服务的归属日持续为本公司提供服务。基于业绩的条件将于本招股说明书构成其一部分的注册声明生效时获得满足。</div></div><div style=line-height:9.07pt;position:absolute;top:532.25pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.96pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:15pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">2025年期权行权及股票归属</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:555.65pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.27pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">下表列出了我们的指定高管于2025年度因行使股票期权及股票奖励归属而取得的A类普通股股份数量，以及该等行权或归属所实现的价值：</div></div><div style=position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:598.85pt;width:612pt><div style=font-size:0;left:72pt;position:absolute;width:468pt><div><table style=border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;width:100%><tbody><tr style=height:0><td style=padding:0;width:195pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td></tr><tr style=height:12pt><td 