ight:11.25pt;font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f"><a href=#if79d5262bb1f4e24ac84b67b9de9b345_12633 style=color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit>目录</a></span></div></div></div></div><div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:72pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:10.46pt>(2)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;left:90pt;width:451.65pt;line-height:10pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">基于我们A类普通股在归属日的公允市场价值，乘以已归属的股份数量计算。</div></div><div style=line-height:9.07pt;position:absolute;top:90.6pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.67pt;left:72pt;width:447.56pt;line-height:14.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">与指定高管的雇佣、离职补偿及控制权变更安排</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:128.4pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.2pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们与Rao先生订立了一份日期为2024年3月2日的录用函，该录用函规定了“随意”雇佣关系，并载明了其初始基本工资、一项新聘员工股票期权授予以及离职补偿和控制权变更福利。Rao录用函于2025年有效，并已于2026年10月终止。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:171.6pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.29pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">具体而言，Rao录用函规定，如果在任何时候其雇佣被本公司无故（“cause”）终止，或其因正当理由（“good reason”）辞职（该等术语定义见Rao录用函），则在其签署以公司为受益方的放弃索赔声明、遵守其保密信息及发明转让协议以及本公司所有重大政策并归还公司财产的前提下，其将会有资格获得以下离职补偿金及福利：(i)相当于其当时六个月基本工资的金额；(ii)支付最多六个月的COBRA保险月度保费；以及(iii)Rao期权中1/8<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:6.175pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;position:relative;top:-2.513pt"></span>的加速归属。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:260.4pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.26pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">Rao录用函进一步规定，如果在“控制权变更”（定义见<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400">我们的</span>2021年计划）之前30日内、发生时或之后的任何时间，其雇佣被本公司无故终止或其因正当理由辞职，则在其签署以公司为受益方的放弃索赔声明并归还公司财产的前提下，其当时尚未行使/尚未归属的股权奖励（包括Rao期权）所涉的当时任何未归属股份将会100%加速归属。如果在控制权变更中，其当时尚未行使/尚未归属的股权奖励原本将在控制权变更事件交割时被无偿终止，则该等奖励将会改为自紧接该交割之前起完全归属。<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400">Rao录用函于2026年10月终止时，我们与Rao先生订立了一份函件协议，按相同条款、不作任何修改地延续本文所述的控制权变更加速归属福利。</span></div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:383.4pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.19pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">有关Rao录用函条款的更多信息，参见“—高管雇佣协议”一节。</span>有关我们指定高管离职补偿福利的更多信息，参见“—财年结束后的薪酬变动及股权奖励”一节。</div></div><div style=line-height:9.07pt;position:absolute;top:426.6pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.96pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:15pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">终止雇佣或控制权变更时的潜在付款</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:450pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.28pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">2025年度，Rao先生有资格根据Rao录用函的条款获得离职补偿福利，详见“—终止雇佣及控制权变更福利”一节。我们的其他指定高管<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">在2025年度均无资格获得离职补偿福利。有关我们指定高管离职补偿福利的更多信息，参见“—财年结束后的薪酬变动及股权奖励”一节。</span></div></div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:504.6pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">非因控制权变更而终止雇佣时的潜在付款</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:525.6pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.29pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">下表列出了在以下情况下我们每位指定高管本应获得的福利的量化估计：其雇佣由指定高管因“正当理由”终止，或由我们基于“因故”以外的理由终止（且并非由于死亡或“残疾”）（“合资格终止”），该指定高管签署了以公司为受益方的放弃索赔声明并遵守了上述其他条件，且该合资格终止发生于2025年12月31日：</div></div><div style=position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:591.6pt;width:612pt><div style=font-size:0;left:72pt;position:absolute;width:468pt><div><table style=border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;width:100%><tbody><tr style=height:0><td style=padding:0;width:155.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:14.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:14.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:14.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td></tr><tr style=height:36pt><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top" colspan=2><div style=left:155.25pt;position:absolute;width:79.5pt><div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;top:10.72pt;width:79.5pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-.97pt;left:18.69pt;width:42.11pt;line-height:8pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:11.05pt;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">现金离职补偿（美元）</div></div></div></div></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top" colspan=2><div style=left:237.75pt;position:absolute;width:79.5pt><div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;top:2.72pt;width:79.5pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-.98pt;left:9.68pt;width:60.15pt;line-height:8pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:13.15pt;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">加速归属股权奖励的价值（美元）</div></div></div></div></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top" colspan=2><div style=left:320.25pt;position:absolute;width:79.5pt><div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;top:2.72pt;width:79.5pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-.98pt;left:20.75pt;width:42.11pt;line-height:8pt;font-family:georgia,s