tyle=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:678.2pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:9.43pt>(1)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;left:90pt;width:450pt;line-height:10pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">“正当理由”“因故”及“残疾”的定义见Rao录用函。</div></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:687.8pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:10.46pt>(2)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;left:90pt;width:450pt;line-height:10pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">此金额相当于Rao先生六个月的年度基本工资，将一次性支付。</div></div></div></div><div class=s1-sheet style="--justify:justify;--position:absolute;background-color:#fff;border:1px solid #cccc;content-visibility:auto;float:none;font-size:0;height:792pt;margin:10px auto;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:relative;width:612pt"><div style=position:absolute;top:720pt><div style=width:468pt><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:22.27pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:298.46pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre>275</font></div></div></div><div style=position:absolute><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:6.46pt;position:absolute;top:13.5pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.4pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.25pt;font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f"><a href=#if79d5262bb1f4e24ac84b67b9de9b345_12633 style=color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit>目录</a></span></div></div></div></div><div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:72pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:10.41pt>(3)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.77pt;left:90pt;width:451.92pt;line-height:9.6pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">此金额代表Rao期权所涉股份总数的1/8<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;position:relative;top:-2.117pt"></span>（1,750,000股）加速归属的价值。此金额系基于截至2025年12月31日我们A类普通股每股17.66美元的公允市场价值，减去每股1.30美元的期权行权价格，再乘以加速归属所涉的股份数量计算。</div></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:100.8pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:10.51pt>(4)</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.78pt;left:90pt;width:451.86pt;line-height:9.6pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">该金额系基于相当于六个月期间COBRA项下持续医疗保险保费成本的付款计算。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:129pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">与控制权变更相关的终止雇佣时的潜在付款</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:150pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.21pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">下表列出了在以下情况下我们每位指定高管本应获得的福利的量化估计：其雇佣因与“控制权变更”（定义见我们的2021年计划）相关的合资格终止而由指定高管终止，该指定高管签署了以公司为受益方的放弃索赔声明并遵守了上述其他条件，且该合资格终止发生于2025年12月31日：</div></div><div style=position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:216pt;width:612pt><div style=font-size:0;left:72pt;position:absolute;width:468pt><div><table style=border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;width:100%><tbody><tr style=height:0><td style=padding:0;width:189pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:51pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:14.25pt></td><td style=padding: