text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们已经或将会是交易一方；</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:204pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:108pt;width:432pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">所涉金额过去或目前超过12万美元；及</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:224.4pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:90pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.72pt>•</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:108pt;width:434.23pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们的任何董事、高级管理人员或持有我们任何类别已发行有表决权证券5%以上的持有人，或上述任何个人或实体的任何直系亲属或与其共同居住的人士，已经或将会拥有直接或间接的重大利益。</div></div><div style=line-height:9.07pt;position:absolute;top:267.6pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.96pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:15pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">股权融资</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:291pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">H轮可赎回可转换优先股融资</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:312pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.29pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">2026年5月至2026年6月，我们以每股589.0095美元的购买价格出售了合计77,637,878股H-1轮可赎回可转换优先股，总购买价格为<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">45,729,447,703美元</span>。下表汇总了关联人购买我们H-1轮可赎回可转换优先股的情况：</div></div><div style=position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:366.6pt;width:612pt><div style=font-size:0;left:72pt;position:absolute;width:468pt><div><table style=border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;width:100%><tbody><tr style=height:0><td style=padding:0;width:331.5pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td></tr><tr style=height:53.25pt><td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style=position:absolute;width:331.5pt><div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;top:43.97pt;width:331.5pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;le