<div style=position:absolute;top:720pt><div style=width:468pt><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:22.27pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:297.84pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre>284</font></div></div></div><div style=position:absolute><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:6.46pt;position:absolute;top:13.5pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.4pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.25pt;font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f"><a href=#if79d5262bb1f4e24ac84b67b9de9b345_12633 style=color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit>目录</a></span></div></div></div></div><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:72pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.2pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">以每股11.2261美元的购买价格发行了89,078股C-1轮可赎回可转换优先股。下表汇总了关联人购买我们C-1轮可赎回可转换优先股的情况：</div></div><div style=position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:103.8pt;width:612pt><div style=font-size:0;left:72pt;position:absolute;width:468pt><div><table style=border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;width:100%><tbody><tr style=height:0><td style=padding