 style="position:absolute;top:-1.73pt;left:2.63pt;width:396.12pt;line-height:8.75pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:7pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">合计</div></div></div></div></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="background-color:#ecebe3;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:470.75pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.16pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">如果承销商认购了任何所发售的股份，则承销商承诺认购并支付全部所发售的股份，但下文所述选择权涵盖的股份除外，除非且直至该选择权获行使。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:502.55pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.25pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">我们将向承销商授予一项选择权，该选择权可自本招股说明书日期起30天内行使，据此承销商可按本招股说明书封面所列的公开发行价格减去承销折扣及佣金，额外购买最多<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">          </span>股A类普通股。承销商仅可为补足与本招股说明书所发售普通股股份的发售有关的超额配售（如有）之目的而行使该选择权。如果根据该选择权购买了任何股份，承销商将按与上表所列大致相同的比例各自购买股份。承销商预计向全权委托账户的销售不会超过所发售A类普通股股份总数的百分之五。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:602.75pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.28pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">下表列示我们和出售股东将向承销商支付的每股及总计承销折扣及佣金。该等金额按承销商额外购买<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">          </span>股A类普通股的选择权未行使和全额行使两种假设列示。</div></div><div style=line-height:9.07pt;position:absolute;top:645.95pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.96pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:15pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">由我们支付</div></div><div style=position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:669.35pt;width:612pt><div style=font-size:0;left:72pt;position:absolute;width:468pt><div><table style=border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;width:100%><tbody><tr style=height:0><td style=padding:0;width:334.5pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td></tr><tr style=height:12pt><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style=left:334.5pt;position:absolute;width:65.25pt><div><div style=line-height:4.53pt;position:absolute;top:4.67pt;width:65.2