idth:334.5pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:3.52pt;width:334.5pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:2.63pt;width:330.87pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;color:#000;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">截至2026年6月30日的余额（未经审计）</div></div></div></div></td><td style="background-color:#ecebe3;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style=left:334.5pt;position:absolute;top:158.25pt;width:65.25pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:3.52pt;width:65.25pt><font style=color:#000;font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:22.17pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre>1,049,631</font></div></div></div></td><td style=background-color:#ecebe3;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="background-color:#ecebe3;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style=left:402.75pt;position:absolute;top:158.25pt;width:65.25pt><div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:3.52pt;width:65.25pt><font style=color:#000;font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre><font style=left:2.63pt;position:absolute>$<font style=display:inline-block;height:7.18pt;width:29.05pt></font></font><font style=left:37.470000000000006pt;position:absolute>25.34<font style=display:inline-block;height:7.18pt;width:3.56pt></font></font></font></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:523.1pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.26pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">截至2025年12月31日止年度及截至2026年6月30日止六个月（未经审计），已归属限制性股票单位的内在价值总额及公允价值均为零。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:554.9pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">限制性股票奖励（“RSA”）</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:575.9pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.29pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">2021年1月及2月，本公司向创始人及早期员工合计授予了17.313亿股RSA，该等RSA基于时间推移（即服务条件）归属。本公司亦向若干非员工服务提供者授予RSA。RSA为已发行在外的普通股股份，如果持有人的服务在限制性股份归属前终止，本公司可（以极低金额）回购该等股份。薪酬成本按相关普通股的授予日公允价值计量，并在归属期内确认。</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:653.3pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.28pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">截至2024年12月31日止年度，4.328亿股RSA已归属，3,610万股RSA可被回购。截至2025年12月31日止年度，截至上一年度末可被回购的全部剩余RSA均已归属，新授予且可被回购的RSA并不重大。</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:696.5pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.16pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">截至2026年6月30日止六个月（未经审计）</span>，本公司就收购事项授予了<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">1,040万股</span>RSA，截至<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">2026年6月30日</span>该等RSA仍未归属。截至<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">2026年6月30日</span>（未经审计），</div></div></div></div><div class=s1-sheet style="--justify:justify;--position:absolute;background-color:#fff;border:1px solid #cccc;content-visibility:auto;float:none;font-size:0;height:792pt;margin:10px auto;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:relative;width:612pt"><div style=position:absolute;top:720pt><div style=width:468pt><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:22.27pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:0;width:612pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:center;text-align-last:center;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">F-53</div></div></div></div><div style=position:absolute><div style=width:468pt><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:6.46pt;position:absolute;top:13.5pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.4pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.25pt;font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict"><span style="font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;color:#00f"><a href=#if79d5262bb1f4e24ac84b67b9de9b345_12633 style=color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit>目录</a></span></div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:24.3pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:0;width:612pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:center;text-align-last:center;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">Anthropic, PBC</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:35.7pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:0;width:612pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:center;text-align-last:center;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">合并财务报表附注（续）</div></div></div></div><div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:72pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.18pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">与未归属RSA相关的未确认的薪酬成本总额约为<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">3.25亿美元</span>，预计将在<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">2.7年</span>的加权平均期间内确认。</div></div><div id=ica694c859b8e458dbf6a73f56dde9d42_1845 style=position:absolute;top:103.8pt></div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:103.8pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">股份回购</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:124.8pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.25pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">截至2025年12月31日止年度，本公司以每股5.61美元的购买价格向若干前任及现任服务提供者回购并立即注销了2,790万股普通股，该价格高于回购时的公允市场价值。所回购股份的公允价值总额为1.49亿美元，计为累计亏损的增加。回购价格超出股份于回购日公允市场价值的部分在合并经营报表中确认为股权激励费用700万美元。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:202.2pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">截至2026年6月30日止六个月（未经审计），本公司未回购任何股份。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:222.6pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.24pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">2026年2月（未经审计），本公司董事会批准了一组第三方买方提出的要约，以每股<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">25.9136</span>美元的价格向卖方购买<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">本公司的</span>A类普通股股份，卖方包括现任及前任员工、非员工服务提供者以及捐赠人建议基金。该要约收购于2026年4月完成，合计出售了<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">1.799亿</span>股股份。要约收购中出售的股份按公允价值出售，因此，本公司未就该交易确认任何股权激励费用。</div></div><div id=ica694c859b8e458dbf6a73f56dde9d42_1856 style=position:absolute;top:300pt></div><div style=line-height:7.56pt;position:absolute;top:300pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.47pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:12.5pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">捐赠匹配计划</div></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:321pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.29pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">2021年11月，本公司采纳了捐赠匹配计划（“<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">捐赠匹配计划</span>”），据此，本公司的合资格员工可承诺<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">向</span>合资格的非营利组织（包括501(c)(3)免税组织）捐款，并由本公司按捐赠匹配计划规定的条款对该等捐款进行匹配。本公司可自行全权酌情决定并根据捐赠匹配计划的条款，选择以N类普通股股份或等值现金进行匹配捐赠。截至<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">2024年</span>及<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">2025年12月31日</span>，已根据捐赠匹配计划预留<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">9.643亿</span>股普通股供发行，且<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">没有</span>已发行或发行在外的股份。截至2026年6月30日（未经审计），已根据捐赠匹配计划预留<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">9.337亿</span>股普通股供发行。截至2026年6月30日止六个月（未经审计），本公司在合并经营报表的其他经营及行政费用中确认了捐赠匹配计划负债的公允价值变动<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">1.26亿美元</span>，并于2026年第一季度（未经审计）在结算其捐赠匹配义务时发行了<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">3,060万股N类普通股</span>。截至<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">2024年</span>及<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">2025年12月31日</span>以及2026年6月30日<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">（未经审计）</span>，本公司在合并资产负债表的应付账款、应计费用及其他流动负债中分别计提了<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">零</span>、<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">5.41亿美元</span>及<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">零</span>，即根据捐赠匹配计划匹配员工捐款的当期义务的估计公允价值，该估计基于可观察输入值和不可观察输入值，并特别考虑了本公司普通股的价格。捐赠匹配费用计入合并经营报表的其他经营及行政费用。</div></div><div id=ica694c859b8e458dbf6a73f56dde9d42_1868 style=position:absolute;top:535.2pt></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:9.07pt;position:absolute;top:535.2pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.96pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:15pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">11. 所得税</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:558.6pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.23pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">本公司须在美国及其他多个州和境外司法管辖区纳税。税前亏损的境内及境外构成如下（单位：百万美元）：</div></div><div style=position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:590.4pt;width:612pt><div style=font-size:0;left:72pt;position:absolute;width:468pt><div><table style=border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;width:100%><tbody><tr style=height:0><td style=padding:0;width:266.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td></tr><tr style=height:12pt><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="background-color:#fff;border-bottom:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top" colspan=5><div style=left:266.25pt;position:absolut