,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">700万美元</span>及<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none">2,100万美元</span>。由于该等资产很可能（可能性大于50%）无法实现，本公司对其递延所得税资产净额维持全额估值备抵。</div></div><div id=ica694c859b8e458dbf6a73f56dde9d42_1879 style=position:absolute;top:360.35pt></div><div style=font-size:12pt;line-height:9.07pt;position:absolute;top:360.35pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.96pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:15pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">12. 每股净亏损</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:383.75pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.27pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">本公司采用参与性证券所要求的两级法计算每股净亏损。本公司A类普通股及N类普通股持有人的权利（包括清算权及股息权）相同，但表决权除外。因此，A类普通股及N类普通股的基本及摊薄每股净亏损相同，故合并列报。</div></div><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:449.75pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.11pt;left:72pt;width:470.21pt;line-height:11.4pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">下表列示了归属于本公司普通股股东的基本及摊薄每股净亏损（扣除税项）的计算（单位：百万<span style="font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400">美元，股份数以千股列示，</span>每股数据除外）：</div></div><div style=position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:492.95pt;width:612pt><div style=font-size:0;left:72pt;position:absolute;width:468pt><div><table style=border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;width:100%><tbody><tr style=height:0><td style=padding:0;width:129.75pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:3pt></td><td style=padding:0;width:65.25pt></td></tr><tr style=height:12pt><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top" colspan=5><div style=left:129.75pt;position:absolute;width:201.75pt><div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;top:2.72pt;width:201.75pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;left:0;width:201.75pt;line-height:10pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:center;text-align-last:center;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">截至12月31日止年度</div></div></div></div></td><td style=font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top></td><td style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;font-size:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top" colspan=3><div style=left:334.5pt;position:absolute;width:133.5pt><div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;top:2.72pt;width:133.5pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;left:0;width:133.5pt;line-height:10p