white-space:pre;width:71.96pt>______________</font></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:164.6pt;width:612pt><font style=font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;left:72pt;position:absolute;text-decoration:none;white-space:pre;width:3.77pt>*</font><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;left:90pt;width:450pt;line-height:10pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">将以修订方式提交。所有其他附件随本注册声明一并提交。</div></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:174.2pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.98pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:10pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">+          表示管理层合同或补偿性计划。</div></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:183.8pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.77pt;left:90pt;width:451.88pt;line-height:9.6pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:-18pt;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">#          注册人已根据S-K条例第601(b)(10)(iv)项删节了本附件的部分条款或条件。虽然本附件的部分内容已被删节，但本附件在其首页载有一项显著声明，说明若干已识别信息已从本附件中排除，因注册人惯常且实际上将该等信息视为私密或保密信息，且所省略的信息不具有重大性。注册人同意应SEC的要求向其提供本附件未经删节的副本。</div></div><div style=line-height:6.05pt;position:absolute;text-align:justify;text-align-last:var(--justify);top:231.8pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-1.77pt;left:90pt;width:451.8pt;line-height:9.6pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:-18pt;text-align:justify;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">^          根据S-K条例第601(a)(5)项，本附件的若干附件、附表及/或附录已被省略。注册人同意应SEC的要求，以补充方式向其提供所有已省略附件及附录的副本。</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=ch-signatures><h2 class=dl-ch>签名</h2><div class=s1-sheets data-first-page=420><div class=s1-sheets-inner><div class=s1-sheet style="--justify:justify;--position:absolute;background-color:#fff;border:1px solid #cccc;content-visibility:auto;float:none;font-size:0;height:792pt;margin:10px auto;overflow:hidden;padding:0;position:relative;width:612pt"><div style=position:absolute;top:720pt><div style=width:468pt><div style=line-height:7.18pt;position:absolute;top:22.27pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-2.35pt;left:0;width:612pt;line-height:11.88pt;font-family:georgia,songti sc,stsong,noto serif cjk sc,source han serif sc,simsun,serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:center;text-align-last:center;white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;line-break:strict">II-8</div></div></div></div><div style=position:absolute><div style=width:468pt></div></div><div><div id=ica694c859b8e458dbf6a73f56dde9d42_979 style=position:absolute;top:72pt></div><div style=line-height:14.36pt;position:absolute;top:72pt;width:612pt><div class=zh style="position:absolute;top:-5.32pt;left:72pt;width:468pt;line-height:25pt;font-family:helvetica,pingfang sc,hiragino sans gb,noto sans cjk sc,microsoft yahei,sans-serif;font-size:20pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0;text-align:left;text-align-last:left;white-space:normal;word-